WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:17.000
Real Mac app: a typed command is planned locally by Qwen through Ollama.

00:17.000 --> 00:24.000
The requested public page opens. A separate goal check confirms the result.

00:24.000 --> 00:38.000
A second command asks Companion to open Wikipedia in a new tab.

00:38.000 --> 00:46.000
The new tab is visible and the app confirms completion.

00:46.000 --> 00:52.500
A new task is started, then stopped. The app returns control immediately.

00:52.500 --> 01:01.264
Native controls expose optional spoken questions and session-memory management.
